  "proved": [
    "Undoing one actual same-copy exchange leaves only one double curve. A disconnected affected normalization consists of two embedded normal components and contradicts fundamentalness.",
    "Explicit upper/lower four-ray tracing excludes nonadjacent outer proper-disk caps and nonadjacent disjoint annular caps by that decomposition.",
